; BUG-011 reproducer (import shape): a directly-imported file that is
; not marked `;@ CBORK: Library` must surface a W007 warning at the
; import directive origin.  The target file defines `dntls-epoch`
; (a CBOR tag #6.1 unsigned integer) but does not declare itself
; a CBORK library, so the consumer is bypassing Step 5.12's
; library contract.
;
; BUG-011 follow-up: the consumer's reference to `dntls-epoch`
; is non-exported in the imported file, so the consumer must
; also surface a W003 warning (cross-file direct-use of a
; non-exported symbol).

;# import "./support/non_library_time.cddl"

start = epoch-only

epoch-only = dntls-epoch